        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86440, Trail Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trail Refrigerator Handle has a simple silhouette that is easy to picture amidst any contemporary decor. It is easy to install and comes with all the hardware you'll need to replace your existing kitchen appliance pull handles. In fact, the  Trail Appliance Handle can be used on the refrigerator, the freezer, and even the dishwasher, so your entire kitchen will match and look its best. This Trail Appliance Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from several modern finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/trail-cabinet-pull-emtek-86161\"><b>Trail Cabinet Pull</b></a>  and <a href=\"/products/trail-cabinet-knob-emtek-86271\"><b>Trail Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Trail Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86440-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek Trail Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86440:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86441:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
